e_reads_linux.go:27-34 falls back on write and seek failure (read; the tests for these are noted in N16).\"},\n  {\"id\":\"R1-N9\",\"status\":\"partial\",\"evidence\":\"Probe: the report now states the list could not be read, and is silent outside a repository; the silencing is too broad and drops index failures in pt-BR (N12).\"},\n  {\"id\":\"R1-N10\",\"status\":\"fixed\",\"evidence\":\"check.go:1145 and 1155 pass both messages through checker.message with Portuguese variants.\"},\n  {\"id\":\"R1-N11\",\"status\":\"not-fixed\",\"evidence\":\"The ready-transition diff at check.go:1131-1134 is unchanged; pre-existing and recorded as an open spec follow-up (crit medium, review 2026-12-26).\"}\n ],\n \"sweep\": \"Read the round 2 diff (c5ff42b4..d93acdc2) and the changed callers; ran the focused cli and pose tests twice under -race and go vet; probed by overlay: unknown revisions, garbage, truncated, bad-checksum, bad-version, unknown-extension, directory and unreadable indexes, broken config and HEAD, non-repository, and de, fr, pt-PT, pt-BR and en locales; mutated ten guards and injected one reachability panic; ran the planned pose tools and both validate commands.\",\n \"criteria\": [\n  {\"id\":\"assumption-integrity\",\"disposition\":\"finding\",\"evidence\":\"N12\"},\n  {\"id\":\"backend-concurrency\",\"disposition\":\"passed\",\"evidence\":\"unit:pose-mcp/go/test\"},\n  {\"id\":\"backend-contracts\",\"disposition\":\"passed\",\"evidence\":\"integration:pose-mcp/go/engine-reads-raw-history-integration\"},\n  {\"id\":\"backend-input-errors\",\"disposition\":\"finding\",\"evidence\":\"N13\"},\n  {\"id\":\"backend-integration-impact\",\"disposition\":\"passed\",\"evidence\":\"integration:pose-mcp/go/check-git-spawns-integration\"},\n  {\"id\":\"backend-observability\",\"disposition\":\"finding\",\"evidence\":\"N12\"},\n  {\"id\":\"compatibility\",\"disposition\":\"passed\",\"evidence\":\"integration:pose-mcp/go/cli-profile-parity-integration\",\"rationale\":\"Examined signatures and callers: ReadOnlyIndex keeps its signature, ReadOnlyIndexContext and GitReadError are additions, reportChangedFiles is internal, report keeps exit 0 and no MCP schema or record format changes. Error wording changes are covered by the findings.\"},\n  {\"id\":\"correctness\",\"disposition\":\"finding\",\"evidence\":\"N12\"},\n  {\"id\":\"design-causality\",\"disposition\":\"passed\",\"evidence\":\"structure:design-f8494a9f32360fb4\",\"rationale\":\"D2 removes the stat-then-open race behind N22 and keeps FIFOs from blocking; D1 and L1 rest on measured Git behaviour; D3 binds the lookup to the caller's context, which addresses R2's deadline. D3's locale claim holds for the diff read only, recorded as N12. The sealed design assessment lists no structural deltas.\"},\n  {\"id\":\"documentation\",\"disposition\":\"finding\",\"evidence\":\"N12\"},\n  {\"id\":\"operability\",\"disposition\":\"finding\",\"evidence\":\"N14\"},\n  {\"id\":\"requirements\",\"disposition\":\"finding\",\"evidence\":\"N12\"},\n  {\"id\":\"scope\",\"disposition\":\"passed\",\"evidence\":\"integration:pose-mcp/go/artifact-claim-boundary-integration\",\"rationale\":\"The spec's artifacts list was extended with the new linux test and the ledger file, matching the 13 implementation files; artifact-check strict exits 0; remaining items are recorded as spec follow-ups.\"},\n  {\"id\":\"security\",\"disposition\":\"passed\",\"evidence\":\"integration:pose-mcp/go/engine-reads-raw-history-integration\",\"rationale\":\"Examined the open and hand-over paths: non-blocking open judged by fstat, 512 MiB bound, sanitised Git environment, 0600 private copy removed after use. Git stderr now reaches findings and the local report; it holds paths and no secrets in the probes, noted as low in N15.\"},\n  {\"id\":\"solution-proportionality\",\"disposition\":\"passed\",\"evidence\":\"unit:pose-mcp/go/test\",\"rationale\":\"The round adds one error helper, one context variant and two replaceable call variables for the fallback test, all small and used. The text heuristic is the cheapest classification and stops being adequate where Git's message is translated or names a revision (N12, N13).\"}\n ],\n \"tools\": [\n  {\"id\":\"artifact-check\",\"disposition\":\"passed\",\"evidence\":\"command:pose artifact-check --spec pose-validate-read-only-index-followups --strict\",\"rationale\":\"Exit 0.\"},\n  {\"id\":\"assess-design\",\"disposition\":\"passed\",\"evidence\":\"structure:design-f8494a9f32360fb4\",\"rationale\":\"Observed, no deltas.\"},\n  {\"id\":\"assess-discover\",\"component\":\"pose-mcp\",\"disposition\":\"passed\",\"evidence\":\"command:pose assess discover --no-persist --component pose-mcp\"},\n  {\"id\":\"assess-integrate\",\"disposition\":\"passed\",\"evidence\":\"integration:pose-mcp/go/engine-reads-raw-history-integration\",\"rationale\":\"Three HTTP consumer gaps reported, on endpoints this range does not touch.\"},\n  {\"id\":\"assess-tech-debt\",\"disposition\":\"passed\",\"evidence\":\"command:pose assess tech-debt --no-persist\",\"rationale\":\"Ran; the scan reports itself incomplete because two older specs could not be read.\"},\n  {\"id\":\"closeout-check\",\"disposition\":\"deferred\",\"rationale\":\"Needs the completed review.\"},\n  {\"id\":\"review-check\",\"disposition\":\"deferred\",\"rationale\":\"Needs the recorded attestation.\"},\n  {\"id\":\"suggest-review\",\"component\":\"pose-mcp\",\"disposition\":\"passed\",\"evidence\":\"command:pose suggest review --path pose-mcp\"},\n  {\"id\":\"surface-check\",\"disposition\":\"passed\",\"evidence\":\"integration:pose-mcp/go/engine-reads-raw-history-integration\",\"rationale\":\"Exit 0 with zero findings.\"},\n  {\"id\":\"validate\",\"disposition\":\"passed\",\"evidence\":\"unit:pose-mcp/go/test\",\"rationale\":\"Rerun in the sandbox: exit 1, 236 steps, 224 pass, 11 fail, 1 timeout. The failed tests match sandbox limits (directory ownership by another user, denied network and delegation, runtime tests failing to start or timing out) or sit in files this range does not touch. Focused subject tests pass under -race. Relies on the sealed evidence.\"},\n  {\"id\":\"validate\",\"component\":\"pose-mcp\",\"disposition\":\"passed\",\"evidence\":\"unit:pose-mcp/go/test\",\"rationale\":\"Rerun in the sandbox: exit 1, 233 steps, 221 pass, 11 fail, 1 timeout. The failed tests match sandbox limits (directory ownership by another user, denied network and delegation, runtime tests failing to start or timing out) or sit in files this range does not touch. Focused subject tests pass under -race. Relies on the sealed evidence.\"}\n ]\n}\n```\nDraft check: the conclusion step would accept this draft.","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01LXmqTmz6HV7azobrN4pXR5","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"rule"}}]}
